    "detailed_description": "Welcome to the Deadliest Laboratory!<br>Here, there are no coincidences\u2014only calculation, tactics, and cold luck. In <strong>9mm Roulette\ud83d\udc80</strong>, your fate is decided with the pull of the trigger of a Magnum 9mm. A deadly experiment is underway in a secret laboratory, where you must outplay your opponents using wit, strategy, and psychological pressure.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454470/extras/a4691d743a0789879287385ffdcd0211.poster.avif?t=1754637661\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454470/extras/a4691d743a0789879287385ffdcd0211.webm?t=1754637661\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454470/extras/a4691d743a0789879287385ffdcd0211.mp4?t=1754637661\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Make your choice: shoot yourself to gain an extra turn or fire at your opponent to take them out of the game. Keep a close eye on the magazine\u2014it holds both live and blank rounds, and only calculated decisions will help you avoid a fatal mistake.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454470/extras/211462a102e3d8dfa7512a02321ffe57.poster.avif?t=1754637661\" width=600 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454470/extras/211462a102e3d8dfa7512a02321ffe57.webm?t=1754637661\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454470/extras/211462a102e3d8dfa7512a02321ffe57.mp4?t=1754637661\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Face off against up to three real players. Bluff, predict your opponents\u2019 moves, and take control of the situation to be the last one standing in this lethal experiment.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454470/extras/f05b4d9a65364b880ffcd1d94af5dd9b.poster.avif?t=1754637661\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454470/extras/f05b4d9a65364b880ffcd1d94af5dd9b.webm?t=1754637661\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454470/extras/f05b4d9a65364b880ffcd1d94af5dd9b.mp4?t=1754637661\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2>\ud83d\udc65 Multiplayer for up to 4 Players<br>Test your nerve and strategic thinking against friends. Every decision could be your last, and every shot could change the course of the game. Play solo or form fragile alliances\u2014but remember, only one will survive in the end.<br><br>\ud83d\udd2b Tactical Russian Roulette<br>This isn\u2019t just a game of chance\u2014it\u2019s a deadly experiment where calculation outweighs luck. Track the bullets in the magazine, analyze probabilities, bluff, mislead your opponents, and make cold, calculated decisions. One wrong move, and you're out.<br><br>\ud83d\udca5 Intense Survival Gameplay<br>Every action must be carefully considered\u2014do you risk shooting yourself for an extra turn, or do you play it safe and wait for the perfect opportunity? Here, victory belongs not just to the lucky, but to those who can strategize, manipulate, and withstand the psychological pressure.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454470/extras/1e107fa58349f0bd90a9c2d7a23b3bb2.poster.avif?t=1754637661\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454470/extras/1e107fa58349f0bd90a9c2d7a23b3bb2.webm?t=1754637661\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454470/extras/1e107fa58349f0bd90a9c2d7a23b3bb2.mp4?t=1754637661\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>\ud83d\udd25 Test your luck or become another failed experiment!",
